{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1486605-demon-the-fallen-s-lore-of-awakening-question","id":1486605,"title":"Demon The Fallen's Lore Of Awakening question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-16T04:36:38-07:00","id":1486605,"title":"Demon The Fallen's Lore Of Awakening question","content":"The Lore Of Awakening level 5 implies that you can put a soul in a body if you have one handy but doesn't explicitly say it. If you have a soul handy, specifically a wraith, could you resurrect the body and place their soul in it using this lore?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3716-mrtwist","name":"Mrtwist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T12:06:15-07:00","id":1486650,"title":"","content":"Look. You can resurrect the dead. But, without a soul, it's just a living body. Demon can possess body. Wraith also can... but they (wraith) will not resurrect.<br /> there is one ritual for such resurrection - Reborn in new skin. House of the Fallen<br /> <br /> You need someone and wraith in fetish/item. Soul will reborn in someones body with his (soul) memory &amp;etc, but physically its not his body (What can be fixed by adding one more Lore) Dead bodies and unbound spirits - the ritual will not work.<br /> The soul of our victim, however, is free from the body. So she will be banished to the world of the dead most likely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25408,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25408-alphari","user":"Alphari","date":". 07-16-2022, 03:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25408-alphari","name":"Alphari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25408_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"153"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T22:51:27-07:00","id":1486721,"title":"","content":"Yes, you can, as the power is written. There's a weird overlap between this power and the Slayers' Lore of the Spirit 5 power, &quot;Restore the Dead,&quot; incidentally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}